    (compareLt none L.y L.r L.carry L.one L.parity) (prepareCompare L).reverse
    (unnormalize L) (prepareSign L).reverse P
    (by intro i s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 m1 m2 m3 m4 m5 m6 m7 e1 e2 e3 e4 e5 e6 e7 r y b z o c
